    description: "FOUND 2026-10-03 while fixing WI-nulig-gipot-samir-movik-latuj-tizin-vagig-lorup (branch jgstern-agent/fix/vinuh), which made an explicitly instantiated generic CALL emit its edge. Residual shapes of the same family, measured and left out of that branch:\n\n1. A generic function used as a VALUE: `register(Map[int])` (function-reference arm, _extract_function_reference_edges) and `Handler: Map[int]` (keyed_element arm). The argument/value is an index_expression (or generic_type), which neither arm reads, so no function_reference_arg / struct_field_reference edge is emitted. Raw tree-sitter census (argument or keyed value whose operand names a generic function declared in the same repo): prometheus 0, alertmanager 0, forgejo 0, otel-collector 2 (confmap/internal/e2e/fuzz_test.go:73,80 targetNested[T]), istio 11 (sets.Set[...] in pilot/pkg/xds/*; may be the generic TYPE Set, not checked).\n2. A method chained on a conversion-spelled instantiation, `Map[int](x).Foo()`: the chained-call branch reads only a call_expression operand, so the receiver is untyped (falls to the generic guards). Not counted.\n\nBoth are the INV-guzuj absent-is-not-empty shape at lower volume than the call arm."  # 0b80
